<title>USA: Ryder System Inc Q3 oper shr $0.42 vs $0.35.</title>
<headline>Ryder System Inc Q3 oper shr $0.42 vs $0.35.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call estimate Q3 $0.44 share.</p>
<p>	  Periods ended September 30, 1996 and 1995</p>
